; a process that holds data built by doubling forty times: some forty cells
; held, a tree of 2^40 items written out. The form of its function does not
; fit the room for a root, so its line carries the digest of its names and
; its payload alone.
def dbl k x =
  case k
    0 -> x
    m + 1 -> dbl m [x, x]
(fn big -> ask [0] (fn c -> ask [2, c] (fn y -> big))) (dbl 40 0)
